em parabenos e óleos Testes: • Sem testes em animais', 166.9, 158.59, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rdyr-lzozpy3e2o2q47', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F619779318%2F23397752169', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
