 50 g Royal Honey Propolis Enrich Toner 160g #SKINFOOD #Royal #Honey #Propolis #Enrich #Essence --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ❤Three Promises of KOKSARA COSMETICS 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.✔ 2.We sell 100% genuine.✔ 3.Chatable time: all the time [24/7].', 140.4, 140.39, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Toner', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-23010-e7zvoza6c4lv3e', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F16923903865', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
