sinfecção três vezes por semana.√ 2.Vendemos 100% genuíno.√ 3.Tempo de carregamento: Todo o tempo [24/7].√ -------------------------------------------------- -------------------------------------------------- -------------- farmstay cica farm revitalizing rolling lifting eye serum stick 25ml shipping from korea - Product details Cooling massage for sensitive eye area with simple rolling Let’s take easy roll-on care for the skin around the eyes/mouth area/neck line that is prone to wrinkles due to the thin skin layer. moisture moisturizing Triple roll-on cooling massage Whitening/wrinkle functionality Pick up without hesitation to prevent wrinkles on your face and revitalize your skin, which determines your first impression. Cica Farm Rolling Eye Serum Skin Age Care Total Solution The vitalizing brush soothes skin brightening Cooling Moisturizing Wrinkle Improvement It soothes the tired eye, mouth, and facial lines and replenishes nutrients. It provides a soft and moist massage with metal applicator cooling care, helps moisturize the skin, and makes the skin clear and plump. [How to use] 1 Lightly massage and roll the areas of concern such as dull skin, mouth area, and nasolabial folds. 2 When wrinkles or fatigue accumulate in the neck line, massage and roll along the neck line as if pressing. 3 Daily cica soothing massage replenishes tired skin around the eyes and facial expression lines with moisture, revitalizing them [Product capacity] 25ml #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price #farm stay ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ———————————————————————————————————————————————————— 🩶Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ -------------------------------------------------- -------------------------------------------------- --------------', 36.63, 35.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Eye Treatment', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-111