TAS – O que faltava para o seu pedal está aqui!', 109.9, 79.9, NULL, 'Sports & Outdoors > Sports & Outdoor Apparels > Sets', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-ma00r0rv7oxu2c', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F379576060%2F23494037127', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
