tebooks Dell, Lenovo, Acer, HP, Asus e muito mais!', 352.79, 278.15, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Desktop & Laptop Components > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825ba-mqsocryl0ge853', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1097013207%2F23393340561', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
