ão, manutenção e uso doméstico.', 132.85, 128.87, NULL, 'Mobile & Gadgets > Accessories > Cables, Chargers & Converters', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rcd3-lrzxu9l3526t92', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F272868574%2F22192867920', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
