', 329.98, 199.99, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Internal Parts', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-m174xcsjcu439e', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F401494968%2F22693421708', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
